{"id":"ne0342444a5","headline":"India-EU FTA progress: European Commission moves to get it signed","summary":"The European Commission has formally proposed signing a free trade agreement with India, clearing the path for early approval by the European Council. Over 99% of Indian exports would gain duty-free EU entry.","why":"The EU and India are large trading partners, and a trade deal would change tariffs on cars, wines and a wide range of goods. It could reshape supply chains and export opportunities.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"trade","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Brussels","country":"Belgium","lat":50.85,"lon":4.352,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/economy/foreign-trade/india-eu-fta-progress-european-commission-moves-to-get-it-signed/articleshow/134080516.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/economy/foreign-trade/india-eu-fta-progress-european-commission-moves-to-get-it-signed/articleshow/134080516.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-09-11T17:03:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"ceae380ccadf4fd8","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-11T17:03:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-11T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/parliament-government-building-3760481.jpg","alt":"parliament government building (illustration)","credit":"Vined","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/hungary-the-hungarian-parliament